<title>BELGIUM: EU sets wheat flour, oat flakes food aid tenders.</title>
<headline>EU sets wheat flour, oat flakes food aid tenders.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union invited tenders by May 13 for supplying Peru with 120 tonnes of common wheat flour as food aid, the EU Official Journal said.</p>
<p>It also invited tenders for the supply of 216 tonnes of oat flakes as food aid, consisting of 48 tonnes for Madagascar and 168 tonnes for Peru.</p>
<p>The wheat flour must be delivered to the port of shipment between June 2-22 and the oat flakes between June 9-29.</p>
<p>The food aid will be distributed via the Euronaid non-governmental organisation, based in The Hague.</p>
<p>--Brussels Bureau +322 287 6830</p>
</text>
